## dest /home/u/.config
plan: switch to profile `new`

observed:
  real directory /home/u/.config

declined. nothing has been changed.

  [R4] /home/u/.config: contains `~/.config/uwsm`, which v1 will not manage under any circumstances. A link here would put it inside the profile too.

## dest /home/u/.local/share
plan: switch to profile `new`

observed:
  real directory /home/u/.local/share

declined. nothing has been changed.

  [R4] /home/u/.local/share: contains `~/.local/share/keyrings`, which v1 will not manage under any circumstances. A link here would put it inside the profile too.

## dest /home/u
plan: switch to profile `new`

observed:
  real directory /home/u

declined. nothing has been changed.

  [R4] /home/u: is your home directory or above it, which v1 will not manage: a link here would hand `~/.ssh`, `~/.config/uwsm` and every other denylisted path to the profile.

