## dest /home/u/.conf
plan: switch to profile `new`

observed:
  real directory /home/u/.conf

declined. nothing has been changed.

  [R4] /home/u/.conf: is a real directory, not the link ricepilot owns. Something (typically a rice installer) replaced the link. Re-linking would discard whatever it wrote; run `ricepilot doctor` and decide deliberately.
